<AliensLayout title="How Aliens List works"><div class="alien-guide"><h1>Free to list. Free to connect.</h1><p>Find the equipment for your next project, pass useful hardware to another builder, or meet people working on similar things.</p>
 <details open><summary>What can I post?</summary><p>Used, refurbished and open-box AI hardware: GPUs, Macs, workstations, servers, edge devices, robotics and components. Post Wanted if you are looking for something. Businesses are welcome; ordinary new retail inventory is outside this board.</p><p>Events currently cover San Francisco and Shenzhen: AI, robotics, computing hardware, semiconductors, makers and hackathons. Use the organizer’s official event link and accurate local dates.</p></details>
 <details><summary>Photos, prices and privacy</summary><p>For sale listings need two different original photos of your actual item. Add the condition, price and what is included. Set 0 for Free; Wanted listings can have an open budget. A photo is not a condition or ownership verification.</p><p>Only an approximate map position is stored. Do not put your street address, phone number or private email in the public description or photos. Share pickup details privately when you are comfortable.</p></details>
 <details><summary>Contact and exchange</summary><p>Open a listing and send a private message. Both members can continue in Messages. Messages are visible to the participants; a reported message can be reviewed by Super ii’s moderators. Block a member to stop new messages in either direction.</p><p>Members agree on payment, inspection, shipping and delivery. Super ii does not provide checkout, escrow, buyer protection or delivery. Check the item and the person before paying.</p></details>
 <details><summary>How long does a listing stay?</summary><p>Hardware listings stay active for 30 days. Renew for another 30 days for free, as often as you need. Mark an item sold or a Wanted request found when finished. Events leave upcoming results when they end.</p><p>New members can publish 3 listings and start 5 conversations per day. Established members can publish 15 listings and start 25 conversations per day. These limits help keep the board useful.</p></details>
 <details><summary>Saved searches and alerts</summary><p>Save a search for the item, area, price and delivery options you need. Matching new listings appear in your bell. Messages and upcoming expiry reminders appear there too. Optional email provides a daily summary of unread updates; it never includes private message text.</p></details>
 <details><summary>Keep the board useful</summary><p>Post items you are entitled to offer and describe defects clearly. No stolen goods, prohibited items, counterfeits, misleading claims, duplicate ads, unsolicited promotion or requests for account credentials. Report suspicious listings or messages from their page. Legitimate posts publish directly; reports are reviewed by moderators.</p><p>Need help with a hidden listing? <a href="/contact">Contact Super ii</a>.</p></details>
 <p class="alien-muted">Maps: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>. City lookup: <a href="https://www.geonames.org/">GeoNames</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.</p><a class="alien-button alien-button--yellow" href="/aliens-list/new">Post free +</a></div></AliensLayout>
